&lt;p&gt;Reporting to our Managing Counsel, you&#39;ll drive high-stakes negotiations independently while serving as a trusted advisor to senior leadership on complex business, risk and legal strategy decisions. This hire can be based in the Bay Area or New York City.&lt;/p&gt;
