&lt;li&gt;Maintain queue tracking and case documentation so the broader team has clear visibility into status and volume.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag patterns or emerging issues to the Senior Privacy Analyst for review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
