&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise written communication — your escalations should give the person receiving them exactly what they need, no more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working independently on well-defined workflows while knowing when to flag something that needs a second set of eyes.&lt;/li&gt;
