&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing experiments that prove (not just suggest) improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with real-time media applications (audio/video, game streaming, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with WebRTC, SDP, SRTP, or DTLS protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with audio/video codecs (Opus, H.264, AV1, etc.) and their corresponding quality measurements (POLQA, PSNR, VMAF, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
