&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A sense of ownership.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You believe in solving a problem completely rather than simply shipping a solution. You operate autonomously and follow through on your commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A growth mindset.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;You view mistakes as learning opportunities and build upon your successes. You challenge yourself and those around you to continuously improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A love of mentorship.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Helping fellow engineers, providing feedback and guidance on system architecture, API design, data modeling, and tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
