&lt;li&gt;Working with cross-functional stakeholders, drive the development of playbooks, tools, systems, and processes that enable automation, scale, and optionality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain a legal knowledge management system, pulled from legal databases, news sources, and work product (such as memos, briefs, or emails)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate the process for sourcing, selecting, and managing external service providers, including managing outside counsel actual spend against budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and train junior team members, and design and deliver client training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
