&lt;li&gt;10+ years litigation paralegal experience, including prior experience at a consumer-facing technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with legal hold systems, matter management software, eDiscovery software, and collecting supporting documentation in collaboration with our lawyers and eDiscovery lead&lt;/li&gt;
