&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Sr. Product Manager to lead our &lt;strong&gt;Nitro Value&lt;/strong&gt; squad. You will be responsible for defining the vision for our premium feature set, launching new high-value experiences while continuously optimizing our existing catalog. You’ll drive execution on the roadmap you create, while partnering with Engagement and other Revenue teams to unlock new monetization opportunities for Nitro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the product philosophy, vision and roadmap for &lt;strong&gt;Nitro Value&lt;/strong&gt;, covering utility, identity, expression features that drive meaningful value to subscribers and increase subscription growth&lt;/li&gt;
