&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of professional software engineering experience with a focus on backend services and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating distributed systems and production services at scale&lt;/li&gt;
